# TypeScript project-reference build output (final production audit: these
# were previously committed by accident — tsconfig.node.json's `composite:
# true` requires `tsc -b` to emit vite.config.js/.d.ts alongside
# vite.config.ts, and both tsconfig*.tsbuildinfo files are pure incremental-
# build cache; none of these should ever be tracked, `vite build` reads
# vite.config.ts directly).
